description	"ISB Enforcer - (Fuse And Stromboli King)

A speedy agent with advanced movement capabilities, tracking abilties and Close Combat expertise to punish hunted suspects...

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- ISB Truncheon (Dual/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- 76/49% less DMG
-- 30% less reach
-- Slap ^3[CS2]
-- On Hit Staggers
- ISB Blaster Pistol (WESTAR)
-- 20% Less FP DMG
-- 10% more DMG
-- 25% more velocity
-- 10% less RoF
- Tracking Darts (4)

^6Inventory:
- Stimshot ^3[CS4]
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- 45% Increased Hack Speed
- 40% Faster Cooldowns
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon
- Mind Trick Resistance
- Knockdown Roll

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS2 Gun]"
- Combat Roll ^3[CS4]
- Tracking Dart ^3[CS3 Melee]


